{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:772","content":{"id":772,"title":"资源存储","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你粘贴或者上传的图片、音视频等资源放在哪里，分为两类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于放在本地的资源会放在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/.editor/resources","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个目录下"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果打开的本地的 Markdown 文件，上传的文件会放在该文件所在的同级目录下，通过相对路径引用文件，方便移动。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"云端"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持配置多种资源存储渠道，包括"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Github"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阿里云 OSS"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"S3"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"WebDav"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些服务的配置可以参考"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":4882,"contentType":"project-item","contentTitle":"同步","refId":762,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同步"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"章节。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果图片放在服务器上，那么对于跨设备，天然就可以访问到这些资源，不需要额外的同步，如果放在本地，我们也支持对 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resources","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 资源进行同步，需要在「同步」设置项中进行配置，也可以手动拷贝文件夹内容。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了保证在离线场景可用以及不必要的流量，软件会自动将访问过的资源缓存到本地，具体的缓存目录是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/.editor/remote-resources","code":true},{"text":"，在访问资源时，如果发现文件已经在本地存在了，则会访问本地文件，不需要发送网络请求。","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为有些资源不常访问，如果挤压的资源过多也会占据空间，在设置页的「杂」项中支持对缓存的各种资源进行清理，包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"音频"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片"}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4033bba0-d9eb-42e0-9d86-ce0ea6d34bff.webp","uuid":"c0917b03-a8c1-4e10-8ee0-d4227bd60b8d","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4033bba0-d9eb-42e0-9d86-ce0ea6d34bff.webp","width":720},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4c6ca6b2-067b-4f75-bc99-02013f782801.webp","uuid":"504bb04a-7691-458c-9dd6-f51ab3749eb2","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4c6ca6b2-067b-4f75-bc99-02013f782801.webp","width":720},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f95043c7-7bd6-4c51-9852-5e91c4d50721.webp","uuid":"16bd5d45-35b3-491c-8684-1783af93729e","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f95043c7-7bd6-4c51-9852-5e91c4d50721.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"child